<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <title>Go Fish</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://stackpath.bootstrapcdn.com/bootstrap/4.5.0/css/bootstrap.min.css" integrity="sha384-9aIt2nRpC12Uk9gS9baDl411NQApFmC26EwAOH8WgZl5MYYxFfc+NcPb1dKGj7Sk" crossorigin="anonymous">
  </head>
  <body>
    <h1>Go Fish!</h1>
    <br>
    <br>
    <h2>How to play:</h2>
    <p>The game will start by you asking the computer for a card. The computer will check to see if it has the card of the same value. If the values of the card match any of the cards in the computers deck, it will hand all of the cards that match over. If it doesn't have any cards, you will draw a card from the deck.
    The computer will repeat the same on it's turn.
    The goal is to get books, four cards of the same value. Whoever has the most books by the time everyone is out of cards including the deck, wins.
    </p>
    <br>
    <a href="/games"><button>Start Game</button></a>
  </body>
</html>